{% decision_card number="ADR-0005" status="approved" %}
One decision. Status reviewed 2026-07-27.
{% /decision_card %}

## Context

The repository already uses Astro static output and must not be replaced with a generic docs starter.

## Decision drivers

- Preserve current app
- Static Cloudflare compatibility
- No client framework runtime
- One build

## Options considered

- Separate docs repository
- Replace marketing app
- Add docs/workspace routes to Astro

## Decision

Keep one Astro static application with marketing at /, documentation at /docs, and simulation at /workspace.

## Positive consequences

- One dependency graph and build
- Existing features remain intact

## Negative consequences

- Docs styles and navigation require custom maintenance

## Risks

- A docs dependency could affect the marketing build

## Follow-up work

- Keep docs CSS scoped by class
- Run the full Astro build

## Supersedes or superseded by

New decision; superseded by: none.

